      "text": "The F.I.R. itself mentions that the documents showed Nayeem Ahmed Khan S/O Nisar Ahmed Khan vs The State Of Maharashtra on 30 January, 2024 Indian Kanoon - http://indiankanoon.org/doc/109968838/\n1 that the tempo was owned by the present applicant.",
