      "end": 2214,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": false
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 23,
      "text": "Considering the 3 of 3 29-aba-827-23 view taken in the order dated 30.01.2024 passed in A.B.A.No.207 of 2024, the facts of the present case are squarely covered by those observation.",
